7. Preserve Scanner Session State

Currently, when users:

switch browser tabs,
switch browser windows,
navigate to another dashboard page,
return to the Scanner,

the Scanner reloads and the current scan state is lost.

This negatively impacts usability.

Expected Behavior

The scanner should preserve the active scan session until the user explicitly clears it or starts a new assessment.

Persist the following:

Current scan
Discovery Workflow progress
Findings
Hero cards
Charts
Recommendations
Selected assets
Active tabs
Expanded panels
Scroll position
Filters
Scan progress
Assessment results

The page should restore exactly as the user left it.

